      "message": "[error] Line 58: 🔴 Android cross builds pass `--target $(YFFI_RUST_TARGET)`, but this change never installs or verifies the corresponding Rust std target. A default rustup install only includes the host target, so Android jobs will fail with `can\u0027t find crate for std`. Add the required `rustup target add` step in the Android build image/setup, or make the contrib rule fail early with a clear message and document/install the required targets.",
